---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base title="Why CO₂ Mosquito Traps Work · GreenGuard USA" description="The science behind CO₂ mosquito trap technology. How and why it outperforms chemical sprays for long-term mosquito control in Austin, TX.">
<style>
  .page { padding: 100px 0 80px; }
  h1 { font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:20px; }
  .lead { font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--text-dim);line-height:1.8;max-width:660px;margin-bottom:48px; }
  .steps { display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:40px;margin:40px 0 56px; }
  .step { display:grid;grid-template-columns:60px 1fr;gap:24px;align-items:start; }
  .step-num { width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(201,168,76,0.15);border:2px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.35);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:900;font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--gold);flex-shrink:0; }
  .step h3 { font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:8px; }
  .step p { font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--text-dim);line-height:1.7; }
  .stats-grid { display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:16px;margin:40px 0; }
  .stat-card { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:24px;text-align:center; }
  .stat-card .num { font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--gold);line-height:1; }
  .stat-card .label { font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:var(--text-faint);margin-top:6px; }
  .vs-row { display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin:40px 0; }
  .vs-box { border-radius:12px;padding:24px; }
  .vs-box.spray { background:rgba(255,80,80,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,80,80,0.2); }
  .vs-box.trap { background:rgba(125,255,170,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(125,255,170,0.2); }
  .vs-title { font-weight:900;font-size:0.95rem;margin-bottom:12px; }
  .vs-list { list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px; }
  .vs-list li { font-size:0.83rem;color:var(--text-dim);padding-left:18px;position:relative; }
  .vs-list li::before { position:absolute;left:0; }
  .vs-box.spray .vs-list li::before { content:'✗';color:#ff6b6b;font-weight:800; }
  .vs-box.trap .vs-list li::before { content:'✓';color:var(--green);font-weight:800; }
  @media(max-width:768px){ .vs-row,.step{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .page{padding:64px 0 60px;} }
</style>

<nav id="site-nav">
  <div class="container nav-inner">
    <a href="/" class="nav-logo">Green<span>Guard</span> USA<small>Smart · Safe · Effective</small></a>
    <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger" aria-label="Menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
    <div class="nav-links" id="nav-links">
      <a href="/services" class="nav-link">Services</a>
      <a href="/pricing" class="nav-link">Pricing</a>
      <a href="/faq" class="nav-link">FAQ</a>
      <a href="/about" class="nav-link">About</a>
      <a href="https://portal.greenguard-usa.com/login" class="nav-link">My Account</a>
      <a href="/book" class="btn-gold">Book Consultation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="page">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
    <div class="section-label reveal">The Science</div>
    <h1 class="reveal">Why CO₂ traps <span style="color:var(--green)">outperform</span> sprays</h1>
    <p class="lead reveal">
      Mosquito sprays kill what's in your yard today. CO₂ traps eliminate the population over time — permanently pulling breeding females out of the local ecosystem before they can bite you or reproduce.
    </p>

    <div class="stats-grid reveal">
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="num">93%</div><div class="label">Bite Reduction at 6 weeks</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="num">24/7</div><div class="label">Continuous Operation</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="num">0</div><div class="label">Pesticides Used</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="num">6–8 wks</div><div class="label">Full Effect Timeline</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-label reveal" style="margin-top:48px;">How It Works</div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Mosquitoes follow CO₂</h3>
          <p>Female mosquitoes locate hosts by sensing carbon dioxide exhaled by humans and animals. CO₂ is their primary navigation signal — they can detect it from up to 100 feet away.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <div>
          <h3>The trap mimics a host</h3>
          <p>Our traps release a precise stream of CO₂ along with heat and humidity to perfectly mimic a warm-blooded animal. Mosquitoes are drawn in from the surrounding area.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Captured, not killed — but stopped from reproducing</h3>
          <p>Mosquitoes are drawn into a collection net. Critically, only female mosquitoes bite and reproduce. Removing females permanently collapses the local breeding population over 6–8 weeks.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-num">4</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Population crash, not just a daily kill</h3>
          <p>Unlike spray services that reset every few weeks, continuous trap operation causes a cumulative population decline. Your yard gets measurably safer every week the trap runs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-label reveal">CO₂ Traps vs. Chemical Sprays</div>
    <div class="vs-row reveal">
      <div class="vs-box spray">
        <div class="vs-title" style="color:#ff8080;">Chemical Spray Services</div>
        <ul class="vs-list">
          <li>Kills mosquitoes present today only</li>
          <li>Population rebounds in 2–3 weeks</li>
          <li>Pesticide residue on plants and soil</li>
          <li>Harmful to bees and beneficial insects</li>
          <li>Requires repeated applications forever</li>
          <li>No population reduction effect</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="vs-box trap">
        <div class="vs-title" style="color:var(--green);">CO₂ Trap Service</div>
        <ul class="vs-list">
          <li>Reduces population permanently over time</li>
          <li>Effect compounds week over week</li>
          <li>Zero pesticides — nothing on your plants</li>
          <li>100% safe for bees and pollinators</li>
          <li>24/7 protection without re-treatment</li>
          <li>Scientifically validated population control</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:56px;text-align:center;" class="reveal">
      <a href="/book" class="btn-gold" style="font-size:1rem;padding:16px 40px;">Book Your Free Consultation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<footer style="border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:40px 24px 28px;text-align:center;font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-faint);">
  © 2025 GreenGuard USA · Austin, TX · <a href="/" style="color:var(--text-faint);">Home</a>
</footer>

<script>
  const btn = document.getElementById('hamburger')
  const nav = document.getElementById('nav-links')
  btn?.addEventListener('click', () => nav?.classList.toggle('open'))
</script>
</Base>
